sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor agent as Agent
  participant srv as MCP server
  participant ff as ffmpeg
  participant mtx as MediaMTX RTSP
  participant fs as Snapshot folder
  agent->>srv: snapshot_camera(name)
  alt name not in KNOWN_CAMS
    srv-->>agent: error: unknown camera
  else known camera
    srv->>ff: ffmpeg -rtsp_transport tcp -i rtsp://127.0.0.1:8554/name -vframes 1
    ff->>mtx: pull one frame
    ff->>fs: write JPEG
    srv->>fs: refresh name_latest.jpg symlink
    srv-->>agent: path and latest link
  end
